                       activeTab === item.id ? 'bg-sky-50 border-sky-100 text-sky-600 shadow-sm' : 'bg-slate-50 border-transparent text-slate-500'
                    }`}
                   >
                     {item.icon}
                     <span className="text-sm font-bold">{item.label}</span>
                   </button>
                 ))}
              </div>
           </div>
        </div>
